Subject: [PATCH 03/45] Add common file and profiling helpers

Add the common utilities used by the AutoFDO host tools: assertion handling,
file-backed mappings and a hash-combining helper.  Keeping these facilities
separate establishes the shared support layer without introducing a profile
format or command-line tool.

