From 6354851ed2c568a02116a1b24745d92000d676f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:34:58 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 06/45] Add the GCOV v3 profile reader and writer

Implement parsing of GCOV AutoFDO v3 profiles into the shared profile
model, and deterministic serialization back out of it.  The reader
validates profile structure and record bounds before exposing data to
higher-level tools; the writer emits the same format so dump, merge, and
create can round-trip v3 profiles.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/gcov_reader.cc: New file.
	* src/gcov_reader.h: New file.
	* src/gcov_reader_v3.cc: New file.
	* src/gcov_writer.cc: New file.
	* src/gcov_writer.h: New file.
	* src/gcov_writer_v3.cc: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
