From b4ab2c4656e499c0c39001a81b3d3fdef82512b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 08/45] Add GCOV profile merge support

Add the library that combines multiple AutoFDO profiles, and the
afdo_merge command that drives it.  The library remaps names and function
identifiers, merges counts and inline trees, and recomputes the resulting
profile summary.  The command validates inputs, writes the merged profile,
and reports merge or write failures.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/afdo_merge.cc: New file.
	* src/gcov_merge.cc: New file.
	* src/gcov_merge.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
