From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:01 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 09/45] Define the sample-scoped DWARF reader API

Define the DWARF types, correlation session, and public reader
interface.  The API documents the split between ELF symbol ownership and
DWARF source attribution before adding the implementation.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/dwarf_reader.h: New file.
	* src/dwarf_types.cc: New file.
	* src/dwarf_types.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
