From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:02 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 10/45] Add symbol, source-path and function lookup helpers

Add helpers for matching GCC symbol names and source paths, looking up
functions by address, and finding overlapping DWARF ranges.  Keep
specialized clone profiles distinct when folding split parts.

Address lookup uses the nearest preceding function entry; callees resolve
only at an exact entry PC.

