From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:04 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 12/45] Describe the Linux perf data ABI

Define the Linux perf.data records, attributes, sample fields, and feature
structures and helpers consumed by afdo_create.  Parsing is introduced
separately.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/perf.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
