From 7fd310a9dfdde64b225a6e45502504c19449807b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:05 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 13/45] Define the profile reader interface

Add the abstract profile_reader interface that the perf, branch-stack
and SPE readers derive from.  It precedes them because a base class
cannot be forward declared, so each reader header needs this
definition to parse.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/profile_reader.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
