From bb85db7e985aa2a6176045937704ecd241bce452 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:06 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 14/45] Add offline perf.data parsing

Add mmap-backed parsing of perf.data headers, event records, attributes, and
address mappings.  The parser exposes normalized event streams while keeping
sampling-mode interpretation in later readers.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/perf_file_reader.cc: New file.
	* src/perf_file_reader.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
