From b38a7b4ff13c32443df2658e51582309ee78e4a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:09 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 17/45] Read BRBE and LBR branch stacks

Implement offline BRBE and LBR ingestion from perf.data.  The reader
converts sampled branch stacks into range, branch, address-frequency, and
mapping data used by correlation.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/perf_branch_stack_reader.cc: New file.
	* src/perf_branch_stack_reader.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
 afdo-tools/src/perf_branch_stack_reader.cc | 317 +++++++++++++++++++++
 afdo-tools/src/perf_branch_stack_reader.h  |  74 +++++
 2 files changed, 391 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 afdo-tools/src/perf_branch_stack_reader.cc
