Subject: [PATCH 19/45] Decode ARM SPE auxiliary packets

Add a self-contained decoder for ARM Statistical Profiling Extension
auxiliary packets.  It reconstructs packet state and reports sampled
addresses, events, contexts, and operation metadata to the SPE reader.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/arm_spe_aux_decode.cc: New file.
	* src/arm_spe_aux_decode.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
