From 298eb4cff225e58794a7243478f0b20f0b3cac16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:12 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 20/45] Read ARM SPE profiles

Add perf.data ARM SPE ingestion on top of the auxiliary packet decoder.
SPE records are translated into normalized address and branch information
before entering the common correlation pipeline, so SPE and branch-stack
profiles share the correlation and export paths.  The afdo_create option
that selects SPE mode is added together with that command later in the
series.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/perf_spe_reader.cc: New file.
	* src/perf_spe_reader.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
