From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:15 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 23/45] Define the AutoFDO run options

Define the run options shared by bucketing, correlation and the profiler
pipeline: thread count, sample threshold, minimum function samples, live
sampling period and the diagnostic dump paths.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/autofdo_options.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
