From 252933680d3c396880fc7a9ae7b3d1917ade08fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:19 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 27/45] Add the profile correlation driver

Add the public driver that sequences bucketing, target materialization, work
estimation, and parallel source correlation.  This provides one
orchestration boundary between perf ingestion and GCOV export.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/autofdo_correlator.cc: New file.
	* src/autofdo_correlator.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
