From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:20 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 28/45] Export correlated profiles as GCOV

Translate correlation builders into the shared GCOV profile model.  The
exporter assigns stable names and identifiers, emits inline trees and
indirect targets, and constructs profile summaries.

