From aad64cb1ba7240686aae54791c78d02cece3e616 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:21 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 29/45] Add AutoFDO profiler orchestration

Add profiler orchestration that loads samples, initializes DWARF,
correlates source data, and exports a profile.  The command-line frontend
remains separate from this reusable pipeline.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/autofdo_profiler.cc: New file.
	* src/autofdo_profiler.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
