From cb24a4161a0c883757060f8bbc3013c6b0a95f1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:25 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 33/45] Add afdo-tools test support and tests

Add the directive-driven DejaGnu harness and the complete afdo-tools
regression suite in one patch.  Coverage includes profile I/O and merge,
address mapping, attribution, offline and live capture, invalid inputs,
determinism, and profile application.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* Makefile.in: Build and run the unit tests.
