From 9ac5d7aa552d5c578951095e5c7399d903223216 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:35:28 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 36/45] Teach cc1 to read GCOV AutoFDO profiles

Build libgcovreader.a from the afdo-tools GCOV reader sources and link it
into the GCC backend so auto-profile can consume GCOV v3 and v4 profiles
produced by afdo_create:

  - compile the shared reader objects with GCC's normal compile and
    dependency machinery
  - drive auto-profile.cc through the shared gcov_reader API
  - add -fauto-profile-format= and -fauto-profile-partial
  - document the options in invoke.texi

Keep position counts lazily materialized while constructing the compiler's
AutoFDO profile model.

Add an end-to-end v4 test that covers format auto-detection, forced partial
reading, the ipa-afdo pass, a hot count and profile-driven inlining.

Regression tested on aarch64-linux-gnu with no new regressions.

gcc/ChangeLog:

	* Makefile.in (GCOVREADERLIB, GCOVREADER_OBJS): Build and link
	libgcovreader.a.  Use the normal compile, dependency and post-compile
	machinery for its objects.
	* auto-profile.cc: Read GCOV v3 and v4 profiles through
	libgcovreader and build afdo_source_profile from gcov_profile.
	(afdo_counts_fit): New.
	(function_instance::materialize_pos_counts): Materialize position
	counts lazily.
	(function_instance::from_gcov): Build function instances from GCOV
	data.  Warn about duplicated inline callsites and use the later record.
	* auto-profile.h (AUTO_PROFILE_VERSION): Update from 3 to 4.
	* common.opt (fauto-profile-format=, fauto-profile-partial): New
	options.
	* doc/invoke.texi: Document the new options.
	* flag-types.h (auto_profile_format): New enumeration.

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

	* gcc.dg/afdo-large-count.c: New test.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-large-count.afdo: New profile.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-duplicate-inline.c: New test.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-duplicate-inline.afdo: New profile.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-duplicate-symbol.c: New test.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-duplicate-symbol.afdo: New profile.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-inline-ambiguous.c: New test.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-inline-ambiguous.afdo: New profile.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-inline-fallback.c: New test.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-inline-fallback.afdo: New profile.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-inline-files.c: New test.
	* gcc.dg/afdo-inline-files.afdo: New profile.

afdo-tools/ChangeLog:

	* testsuite/afdo-test/afdo-fauto-profile-v4.c: New test.
	* testsuite/lib/afdo.exp (dg-afdo-opt-profile-options): New.
	(afdo_recompile_opt_dump): Apply the requested reader options.

